<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.8.8">
<l>valleyiṟṟuk kēḻalumāy vāḷeyiṟṟuc cīyamumā</l>
<l>yellaiyillāt taraṇiyaiyu mavuṇaṉaiyu miṭantāṉū</l>
<l>relliyampō tiruñciṟaivaṇ ṭemperumāṉ kuṇampāṭi</l>
<l>mallikaiveṇ caṅkūtum matiḷaraṅka meṉpatuvē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The city of him who,</l>
<l rend="indent">as a strong tusked boar [and] a sharp toothed lion,</l>
<l rend="indent">dug out the limitless earth and the [chest of] the demon,</l>
<l>is called walled Araṅkam</l>
<l rend="indent">where in the evening huge winged beetles sing</l>
<l rend="indent">[about] the virtues of our Perumāṉ</l>
<l rend="indetnt">[and] play the white conch[-like] Jasmine.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
